      <memberdef kind="define" id="uTransmission_8h_1a056e4bc2bde4678659c2b48c1186ec7c" prot="public" static="no">
        <name>JOINT2ACTUATOR</name>
        <param><defname>in</defname></param>
        <param><defname>reduction</defname></param>
        <param><defname>offset</defname></param>
        <initializer>(reduction * (<ref refid="joint_8h_1a018130d8f5ce298859605a5c8e1320ee" kindref="member">in</ref> - offset))</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Macro for a simple transmission from joint units to actuator units. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The translation is based on the ros2_control transmission interface, simple transmission. For position reduction and offset need to be used.<linebreak/>
For velocity and acceleration only use reduction and NO offset <linebreak/>
For effort/torque use 1/reduction and NO offset <linebreak/>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
